## Workflow

Automatically select and load the `engineering` Skill for feature implementation, bug
fixes, refactoring, API/database/UI changes, and any other non-trivial code change. Do
not require the user to type `/engineering` or name the Skill.

Project Agents must not edit `.hek/fitness/**`; every other Fitness change, regardless
of size, requires external human approval bound to the exact change digest.

## Requirement Reflection

Before sending a response or taking a side effect, apply the response-level reflection
in `.hek/kit/core/requirement-reflection.md` and classify the result as `ready`,
`clarify`, `correct`, or `blocked`. On anything but `ready`, stop consequential work,
state the finding and evidence, give the best option, and ask.

